Cell["5. Contract the four diagrams and compare with GR", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8eef3933-498e-4665-abb7-e492a3be7a97"],

Cell["\<\
Check FORM availability. The contraction helper was defined in section 1. \
Each contraction uses the same quadratic-gravity model, momentum routing, \
graph factors and external tensors as the diagrams above.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8e07c45f-1460-402c-9b6f-4c7d4b20da55"],

